# Copy to matter-watchdog.env (gitignored) and fill in.
# Create a "Push" monitor in uptime-kuma (http://<pi>:3001), copy its Push URL:
#   Settings -> + Add -> Monitor Type: Push -> Save -> copy the "Push URL"
# It looks like: http://127.0.0.1:3001/api/push/AbCdEf1234
# The watchdog appends ?status=up&msg=... on every healthy run; if it stops
# heartbeating, uptime-kuma marks the monitor down and alerts you.
#
# Use a SEPARATE monitor from the printer watchdog — sharing one would let a
# healthy printer mask a dead Matter fabric.
KUMA_PUSH_URL=""
